  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize the Aces. Holding two Aces in a 6-card hand makes you nearly guaranteed to capture at least 10 points. If your partner also holds an Ace, you have 20 pointsâ€”just one point shy of winning the round.\n\nTrump Defensive: If the opponent chooses trumps, lead low cards in your 'longest' suit to force them to use their trump cards early. If you can exhaust their 6 trump cards, your remaining Aces becomes masters.\n\nThe 'Kapot' Strategy: If your team has high cards in all suits, aim for 'Kapot' (winning all 6 tricks). This erases multiple branches (usually 2 or 3) and is the fastest path to victory.",
